            "review_title": "Review at 4U Beach Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Алина\nSochi, Russia178 contributions\n0\nNot clean\nSep 2026 • Couples\nYou can write it like this—honestly, but without unnecessary harshness:\n\nIn Russian:\nThis was our first restaurant after arriving in Da Nang - we came here for dinner almost immediately after checking in. Ordered a huge grouper: the fish was interesting and we generally liked it. And the bill at the end impressed us much more than we expected - it turned out to be quite expensive.\n\nThe restaurant itself, unfortunately, seemed not very well-kept. Cleanliness is clearly lacking: our table was sticky, and in general, I would like the hall to be monitored more carefully. For a place by the sea with this price level, I would like a more neat and pleasant atmosphere.\n\nIn Vietnamese:\nThis is the first restaurant we visited for dinner right after arriving in Da Nang. We ordered a very large grouper, the fish was quite interesting and overall we found it delicious. However, when paying, the price was quite surprising to us — much more expensive than we thought.\n\nThe downside is that the restaurant seemed not to be well-maintained and clean. Our table is sticky and overall the space does not feel clean or tidy. With a seaside restaurant at that price point, we expect the ambiance to be better maintained.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten September 14, 2026",
