            "review_title": "Review at 4U Beach Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Ana Macedo\nStockholm, Sweden88 contributions\n0\nNothing special\nDec 2019 • Family\nDon’t be fooled if it’s packed because this restaurant isn’t anything special. There are no seafood platters and the dishes itself are quite pricey for the quality. If you want more than just a plate of shrimps you really need to order it aside. \nService was not that great either, their English is not the best and they seem rather afraid or just not interest at all to serve you. \nWe were shocked too that we were charged the tissue that was left at each table for us to clean our hands after the seafood, usually those are free in every restaurant... I mean.. we did not even ask for them, they were there along with the cutlery.. \nIt was disappointing, i don’t really recommenced it and from what I heard from some of the locals, they told me they would not go there either.\nRead more\nWritten December 21, 2019",
